    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNestled within the prestigious grounds of Druids Glen Resort, adjacent to the renowned Marriott Hotel, this truly exceptional two-bedroom residence is an absolute showstopper. Generous in size and presented in immaculate condition throughout, the property has been meticulously maintained and extensively upgraded by its current owners, creating a luxurious turnkey home in one of Wicklow's most sought-after locations.\nFrom the moment you step inside, you are welcomed by an immediate sense of space, style and quality. Beautiful light oak flooring flows seamlessly throughout the accommodation, while an abundance of natural light enhances the warm and inviting atmosphere. The stunning living room is undoubtedly one of the property's standout features, boasting impressive vaulted ceilings and a large picture window that perfectly frames the beautifully landscaped surroundings, bringing the outdoors in and creating a wonderful sense of tranquillity.\nThe living space flows effortlessly into the recently renovated kitchen, expertly designed with an extensive range of floor and eye-level units, premium integrated appliances, quartz worktops and elegant tiled flooring. A door leads directly to the patio area, providing the ideal setting for outdoor dining or simply relaxing while enjoying the peaceful surroundings.\nThe superb principal bedroom has been thoughtfully reconfigured to maximise space and comfort, resulting in an elegant retreat complete with fitted drawers and a beautifully appointed ensuite bathroom. Finished to an exceptional standard, the ensuite features high-quality tiling, a luxurious bath, separate shower enclosure, stylish vanity unit and carefully curated lighting throughout.\nA second spacious double bedroom enjoys the same high standard of finish, with oak flooring, built-in wardrobes and an abundance of natural light. Positioned adjacent is a beautifully renovated guest shower room, tastefully tiled and fitted with contemporary sanitary ware.\nThe current owners have invested significantly in the property, with upgrades including a stunning contemporary kitchen, luxurious bathroom suites, quality flooring and numerous additional improvements that enhance both comfort and style.\nSet amidst the magnificent surrounds of Druids Glen Resort, this beautiful home enjoys an unrivalled sense of privacy and peace while benefiting from world-class amenities on its doorstep. Surrounded by mature landscaped grounds and beautiful countryside, it offers a rare opportunity to acquire a luxurious residence in a truly outstanding setting.\nCombining elegant interiors, exceptional upgrades and an enviable location, this remarkable property is sure to impress even the most discerning purchaser.”"
      },
